#    engine's session when a runtime stops (an unload or a parked idle agent is not a release: TS forgot the session's turn marks, the
#    pages it owned and the sign-in memory only in `releaseSession`, so after a core unload the desktop kept `turnFinishedAt`). Replace the
#    struct, its impls and its test module with:
